# Build context is the repo ROOT. Keep it small and never ship secrets.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/eslint-reports
.git
.github
**/.husky
# Never send real env files into an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
# Docs / editor noise
**/*.md
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
